[{"answer":"Good morning and welcome, everybody.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/1.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm Jenny Stewart","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/2.mp3"},{"answer":"and I'm the Staff Manager here at the exhibition centre.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/3.mp3"},{"answer":"We're expecting this year's International Travel Exhibition","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/4.mp3"},{"answer":"to attract over 10,000 visitors a day, ladies and gentlemen,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/5.mp3"},{"answer":"and you are among the 200 extra staff recruited to help look after them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, to help things run smoothly,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/7.mp3"},{"answer":"we have divided you into four teams -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/8.mp3"},{"answer":"the blue team, the green team, the red team, and the yellow team.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/9.mp3"},{"answer":"So first, I'll explain how the teams are divided up,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/10.mp3"},{"answer":"and then we'll be giving you colour-coded T-shirts so we can identify you more easily.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/11.mp3"},{"answer":"First of all, those who will be looking after the phones","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/12.mp3"},{"answer":"and handling all calls regarding the exhibition,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/13.mp3"},{"answer":"you will be on the red team.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, we've also put the entrance staff on the red team","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/15.mp3"},{"answer":"and you'll be stamping the entrance tickets and giving out publicity leaflets, okay?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Those of you involved in distributing entrance tickets will be on the yellow team","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/17.mp3"},{"answer":"and we've also put those of you who'll be staffing the information booths around the conference centre on the yellow team, so...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/18.mp3"},{"answer":"you'll be getting a yellow T-shirt.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, most of the hospitality staff have been put in the blue team,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/20.mp3"},{"answer":"so the chefs among you and the kitchen hands will all need a blue T-shirt, but...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/21.mp3"},{"answer":"because of the sheer numbers,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/22.mp3"},{"answer":"all waiting staff will be on the yellow team,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/23.mp3"},{"answer":"and this includes the bar staff among you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Those who will be monitoring and directing the traffic in the car parks are on the green team,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/25.mp3"},{"answer":"so you'll need to get a green T-shirt.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/26.mp3"},{"answer":"This year, we've also employed a considerable number of attendants","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/27.mp3"},{"answer":"to direct the human traffic around the conference centre.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, you'll be working in the exhibition hall at all times,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/29.mp3"},{"answer":"giving directions and generally helping people whenever you can,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/30.mp3"},{"answer":"and you will be in the red team, so please collect a red T-shirt.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, now that everyone knows what team they're in,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/32.mp3"},{"answer":"we'll get on with the orientation and training programme","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/33.mp3"},{"answer":"and first, I'll run through the rest of today's programme,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/34.mp3"},{"answer":"which you should have in front of you,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/35.mp3"},{"answer":"so that you can get a general idea of what else is in store today.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/36.mp3"},{"answer":"This introduction finishes at 9.30","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/37.mp3"},{"answer":"and then you'll be hearing from Anne Smith.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Anne works in the accounts department on level two","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/39.mp3"},{"answer":"and she looks after all temporary staff,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/40.mp3"},{"answer":"and so she is the person to see if you have any problems regarding pay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Anne will be explaining when and how you get this.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/42.mp3"},{"answer":"She will also be handing out your tax forms.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/43.mp3"},{"answer":"And I will just stress that all tax forms must be completed","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/44.mp3"},{"answer":"and returned to Anne before your pay can be processed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Following Anne's talk you'll hear from Peter Chen, our Conference Manager,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/46.mp3"},{"answer":"and he will be going over a plan of the conference centre with you,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/47.mp3"},{"answer":"which will help you to orient yourselves.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/48.mp3"},{"answer":"He will also go through the security arrangements with you","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/49.mp3"},{"answer":"and show you the fire exits.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Then at 10.30,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/51.mp3"},{"answer":"there will be a coffee break in the staff canteen,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/52.mp3"},{"answer":"which is located down on the ground floor.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, after the break,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/54.mp3"},{"answer":"we'll be moving to a different location for a video presentation,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/55.mp3"},{"answer":"so instead of coming back here,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/56.mp3"},{"answer":"we'd like you all to go to Lecture Room 311.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/57.mp3"},{"answer":"You'll find it on this same level, just down the hall,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/58.mp3"},{"answer":"and there you will be shown a video about important safety issues in the workplace,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/59.mp3"},{"answer":"called Safety at Work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/60.mp3"},{"answer":"We'll finish off the morning with lunch,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/61.mp3"},{"answer":"which should give everyone a chance to meet and get to know each other,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/62.mp3"},{"answer":"and we'll be serving you a buffet lunch in the Main Hall,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/63.mp3"},{"answer":"which is on the first floor, from 12.00 o'clock.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/64.mp3"},{"answer":"After lunch, you'll be divided up into your teams to meet your team leaders","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/65.mp3"},{"answer":"and we're hoping to be all finished by 3.00, so...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/66.mp3"},{"answer":"I won't delay you any longer...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-6-test-4-part-2-2023-08-03-14-47-19/67.mp3"}]
